81","position":{"commit_sha":"7855d4a309873c001a81bd8aeb9fa200c3ebf91b","position":"1786307490474388001-b0fb9962-9155-4d74-9c5b-1865b6683281"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"33cb6d2da7c5c00854a91d359ab09caf654b20198202ebf43f7a9990a7223ee3","event_uuid":"c150ed6a-6ba5-45dc-8ad9-2579201c2e9b","position":{"commit_sha":"c1c6d21680862060a3e4da2d1ce57bd29a5476b8","position":"1786312652157519514-c150ed6a-6ba5-45dc-8ad9-2579201c2e9b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-226_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"f5243f27-ee4f-4752-bd07-9bbe31d60cab","comments":[],"created_at":1786102675044531001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"91a7f127-d807-4068-8112-e1c5dc1904fc","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"dbb2-e329-994d-4c8f"},{"link_uuid":"c150ed6a-6ba5-45dc-8ad9-2579201c2e9b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0f10-2f0c-693d-4740"}],"description":"Discovered while fixing [rebar:dbb2-e329-994d-4c8f]. Not a defect — a cleanup that removes\nnow-dead duplication.\n\n`tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/` shadows the engine `rebar_reconciler` package whenever pytest\ncollects anything under `tests/unit/` (prepend import mode puts `tests/unit` at `sys.path[0]`).\nThe workaround — appending the engine package dir to the shadow's `__path__` — had been written\nout THREE times, each independently:\n\n* `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conftest.py` (`_seed_dotted_namespace`, the original, f32b19b1e7)\n* `tests/unit/test_canonical_consolidation.py:66-67` (inline, comment: \"like\n  `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conftest.py`\")\n* `tests/unit/test_code_review_artifact.py:118-119` (inline, comment: \"the pattern the reconciler\n  conftest uses\")\n\nThe two inline copies are exactly the fingerprint of the dbb2 defect: both live in TOP-LEVEL\n`tests/unit` modules, i.e. two prior authors hit the same shadow from outside\n`tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/` and patched locally instead of hoisting the compensation.\n\ndbb2's fix hoists it to `tests/unit/conftest.py`, which now runs for every `tests/unit`\ncollection. All three older copies are therefore redundant. They are harmless (each checks\nmembership before appending, so they no-op), which is why dbb2 deliberately left them alone\nrather than widening its diff.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The two inline copies are removed, and each call site relies on the `tests/unit/conftest.py`\n      bridge instead\n- [ ] Decide and record whether the `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conftest.py` copy stays: it is\n      arguably still worth keeping as local documentation at the site of the shadow, but it is no\n      longer load-bearing\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/test_canonical_consolidation.py tests/unit/test_code_review_artifact.py`\n      passes both alone and in a mixed selection with `tests/scripts/reducer`\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/rebar_reconciler` still passes (2288 tests)\n- [ ] The dbb2 guard\n      (`tests/unit/test_engine_dir.py::test_engine_submodules_resolve_when_the_tests_unit_shadow_is_active`)\n      still passes","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["relates_to","0f10-2f0c-693d-4740"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"e5cdf855-5273-41c6-8373-e3245391b61a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"8120-6d1c-58cb-4473","ticket_type":"task","title":"Drop the now-redundant inline rebar_reconciler __path__ workarounds","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["483f3a7b-81fc-4c5b-ba27-a9d2da273179","91a7f127-d807-4068-8112-e1c5dc1904fc","c6898acc-e8f5-4caf-842a-244aa0baa7e1","e5cdf855-5273-41c6-8373-e3245391b61a","b0fb9962-9155-4d74-9c5b-1865b6683281","c150ed6a-6ba5-45dc-8ad9-2579201c2e9b"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786312652157519515,"uuid":"ebfc4453-77ed-4eaf-ba61-0c5be2b11f51"}